# This project is about the interop: a C++ core with a hand-written C ABI, driven
# by three independent clients — C# through P/Invoke, Python through ctypes, and
# TypeScript through Emscripten. The language bar showing all four IS the point,
# so nothing here is hidden from linguist.

# The public ABI header is C-linkage but part of the C++ core; count it as C++
# rather than letting it split the core's byte count across two languages.
core/include/*.h linguist-language=C++
